accountSetup.masterkeyFileTemplate:
Concrnt Master Key
This file is used to recover your Concrnt account.
Store this file in a safe place.

CCID: {{ccid}}
Master Key: {{mnemonic}}
Registered server: {{domain}}

If you lose your master key, you may not be able to recover your account.
If someone else learns this information, your account may be taken over.

backupKeyButton.fileTemplate:
Concrnt Login Information
This file is a backup of your Concrnt login information.
Store this file in a safe place.

CCID: ${ccid}
Master Key: ${mnemonic_ja}
Registered server at backup: {{domain}}

If you lose your master key, you will not be able to recover your account.
If someone else learns this information, your account may be permanently taken over. Store it in a safe place.
